  {
    "@id": "https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl",
    "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/rights": [
      {
        "@value": "Copyright POSC Caesar Association"
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "QualityDatum Value Aspect Extension Ontology OWL"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@value": "2026-05-07"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator": [
      {
        "@id": "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-7263-9946"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@value": "Defines value aspects of lis:QualityDatum as OWL ontology\nBackground:\nThe Industrial Data Ontology (IDO) already establishes a clear distinction between properties (lis:Quality) and values (lis:QualityDatum).\nBuilding on this foundation, this ontology introduces aspects to further refine the semantics of values (lis:QualityDatum).\nAspects enable a more granular and standardized representation of value-related information,\nallowing for precise classification and contextualization of characteristics that describe specific values (lis:QualityDatum),\nsuch as ranges, thresholds, or other value-specific attributes.\n\nThis ontology aligns with IEC 61360-1, particularly its LEVEL_TYPE concept (MIN, NOM, TYP, MAX),\nwhich is now implemented more flexibly by representing each role as a separate class and\nsupporting all four values to enable precise semantic composition of value aspects.\n\nThis ontology is inspired by and extends the plm ontology from POSC Caesar Association (PCA)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/plm/ont/core"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@value": "2026-06-01"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/title": [
      {
        "@value": "QualityDatum Value Aspect Extension Ontology OWL"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo": [
      {
        "@value": "0.1.0"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports": [
      {
        "@id": "https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/"
      },
      {
        "@id": "http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/ont/core"
      }
    ],
